# Preset YAML writes

Preset files are **`config.yaml`** under `projects/<slug>/`. Mutations must preserve `#` comments and survive concurrent writers.

## Do this

- Use `update_preset_yaml_tree(path, mutator)` for read-modify-write.
- Use `preset_yaml_transaction(path)` when holding the lock across multiple steps.
- Atomic write via `dump_preset_yaml_document` (`.partial` temp + replace).
- Validate with `parse_preset_dict` unless the mutator already guarantees shape.

## Callers

- `site_suggestions/preset_io.py` — `build --suggest` append/remove sites
- `plss_fetch.py` — CadNSDI SECDIVID enrichment on sites/goals

## Avoid

- Direct `open(preset).write(...)` or stdlib `yaml.dump`.
- Unlocked read-modify-write (race with parallel suggest or enrichment).
- Dropping ruamel round-trip for "simple" one-field edits.
